      "title": "EcAMSat spaceflight measurements of the role of σs in antibiotic resistance of stationary phase Escherichia coli in microgravity",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Padgen M.R."
        },
        {
          "name": "Lera M.P."
        },
